1
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:10,703
Russia is our sacred state,

2
00:00:10,736 --> 00:00:17,278
Russia is our beloved country.

3
00:00:17,532 --> 00:00:24,195
A mighty will, a great glory -

4
00:00:24,273 --> 00:00:30,777
Yours forever for all time!

5
00:00:31,481 --> 00:00:37,809
Be glorious,

6
00:00:38,522 --> 00:00:44,301
our free Fatherland,

7
00:00:45,286 --> 00:00:51,536
Ancient union of brotherly peoples,

8
00:00:52,196 --> 00:01:05,533
Ancestor-given wisdom of the people!

9
00:01:06,243 --> 00:01:08,746
Be glorious, our country!

10
00:01:08,797 --> 00:01:16,199
We are proud of you!